<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Airline year net profit 332.86 m.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Airline year net profit 332.86 m.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31, 1997 in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		   332.86    vs   232.94</p>
<p>    Group share (cents)	 43.8     vs    33.3</p>
<p>    Turnover		   6,484.95    vs  5,713.31</p>
<p>    Pretax			 349.41    vs    251.16</p>
<p>    Minorities		less 1.12    vs less 0.09</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries		0.16    vs     14.73</p>
<p>    Total Dividend (pct)	10.0     vs	7.5</p>
<p>Note - Malaysia Airline System Bhd is Malaysia's national carrier.</p>
</text>
